  "body": "The [worker documentation](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/dd5e5dc1d6c88a3532d25f18cfc312d8bc813473/docs/workers.md) currently only mentions placing the media Admin APIs on a worker other than the main process. It seems like other Admin APIs could also be moved off as well though, especially the read-only calls.\r\n\r\n`GET /_synapse/admin/v1/rooms/<room_id>` is one such example:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/ad8589d39254559b3eb4f38c528f8fc827dc4763/synapse/rest/admin/rooms.py#L285-L310\r\n\r\nThis becomes more important as more bots and processes are built on top of these APIs, and end up calling them frequently.",
